# Laid out Medium, a chat's side panel a panel of its own on the tape (sfdesk frame.mbt): MBUI_WIN=690x840
# MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2, an opened fold's inner screen upright, a finger. The page brought over from the sidebar, the
# panel opened from the chat's bar (it comes over, the page's edge showing at its left), back (the page over, the
# panel's edge at its right), the panel's edge tapped (over again), back twice (the page, then the sidebar).
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 1000
tapxy -80 420
wait 1300
tap icon:panel-open
wait 1500
back
wait 1300
tapxy -60 420
wait 1300
back
wait 1300
back
wait 1300
exit
